  by: agent  # 48a8
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 48a8
  clock: 13  # 48a8
  nonce: 48a8  # 48a8
  message: "ADR-0038 ruling 3 (bridge eviction) landed dev 16c0817330 (vocab F4 PR2) — the last of INV-kudug's four named closers (rulings 1/3/4/5) to materialize. The ~20 FFI-bridge/protocol stamps that carried access_mode='write'+dest_access_mode='read' as a *direction* smuggle now emit the new data_direction='src_to_dst' key and carry NO access_mode; dest_access_mode is removed entirely (it was zero-entropy). event_publishes keeps access_mode='write' (genuine channel write). Item already satisfied via rulings 1/4 (read-derivation + mutator tables, dev e70e2ef759); this note records that the direction-eviction half is now also in the tree, so no access_mode='write' on a bridge edge can be re-read as an access mislabel."  # 48a8
